    <li>lodgerSurgeryVioLeaveMapLetterText-&gt;[letterIntroViolated]\n\n[decidedToLeave]</li>
    <!-- EN: letterIntroKidnapped-&gt;{SUBJECT_definite}, [oneOfThe], was kidnapped. -->
    <li>letterIntroKidnapped-&gt;{SUBJECT_definite}, [oneOfThe], foi sequestrado.</li>
    <!-- EN: lodgerKidnappedLeaveMapLetterLabel-&gt;[lodgersLabel] kidnapped: Departure -->
    <li>lodgerKidnappedLeaveMapLetterLabel-&gt;[lodgersLabel] sequestrado: partida</li>
    <!-- EN: lodgerKidnappedLeaveMapLetterText-&gt;[letterIntroKidnapped]\n\n[decidedToLeave] -->
    <li>lodgerKidnappedLeaveMapLetterText-&gt;[letterIntroKidnapped]\n\n[decidedToLeave]</li>
    <!-- EN: letterIntroBanished-&gt;{SUBJECT_definite}, [oneOfThe], was banished. -->
    <li>letterIntroBanished-&gt;{SUBJECT_definite}, [oneOfThe], foi banido.</li>
    <!-- EN: lodgerBanishedLeaveMapLetterLabel-&gt;[lodgersLabel] banished: Departure -->
    <li>lodgerBanishedLeaveMapLetterLabel-&gt;[lodgersLabel] banido: partida</li>
    <!-- EN: lodgerBanishedLeaveMapLetterText-&gt;[letterIntroBanished]\n\n[decidedToLeave] -->
    <li>lodgerBanishedLeaveMapLetterText-&gt;[letterIntroBanished]\n\n[decidedToLeave]</li>
    <!-- EN: letterIntroPsychicRitualTarget-&gt;{SUBJECT_definite}, [oneOfThe], was the target of a psychic ritual. -->
    <li>letterIntroPsychicRitualTarget-&gt;{SUBJECT_definite}, [oneOfThe], foi alvo de um ritual psíquico.</li>
    <!-- EN: lodgerPsychicRitualTargetLabel-&gt;[lodgersLabel] violated: Departure -->
    <li>lodgerPsychicRitualTargetLabel-&gt;[lodgersLabel] violado: partida</li>
    <!-- EN: lodgerPsychicRitualTargetText-&gt;[letterIntroPsychicRitualTarget]\n\n[decidedToLeave] -->
    <li>lodgerPsychicRitualTargetText-&gt;[letterIntroPsychicRitualTarget]\n\n[decidedToLeave]</li>
    <!-- EN: ShuttleDestroyedIntro-&gt;The shuttle has been destroyed. -->
    <li>ShuttleDestroyedIntro-&gt;O ônibus espacial foi destruído.</li>
    <!-- EN: ShuttleDestroyedLabel-&gt;Shuttle destroyed: Parade failed -->
    <li>ShuttleDestroyedLabel-&gt;Ônibus espacial destruído: o desfile fracassou</li>
    <!-- EN: ShuttleDestroyedText-&gt;[ShuttleDestroyedIntro]\n\n[decidedToLeave] -->
    <li>ShuttleDestroyedText-&gt;[ShuttleDestroyedIntro]\n\n[decidedToLeave]</li>
    <!-- EN: raidArrivedLetterLabel-&gt;Deserter assassination attempt -->
    <li>raidArrivedLetterLabel-&gt;Tentativa de assassinato dos desertores</li>
    <!-- EN: raidArrivedLetterText-&gt;A group of deserters have arrived to attempt to disrupt the parade and assassinate [stellarch_nameDef].\n\nThe parade must not be interrupted for any reason! -->
    <li>raidArrivedLetterText-&gt;Um grupo de desertores chegou para tentar atrapalhar o desfile e assassinar [stellarch_nameDef].\n\nO desfile não pode ser interrompido por motivo nenhum!</li>
    <!-- EN: ParadeSuccessLetterLetterLabel-&gt;Parade success -->
    <li>ParadeSuccessLetterLetterLabel-&gt;Sucesso no desfile</li>
    <!-- EN: ParadeSuccessLetterText-&gt;The shuttle is ready to depart with all those ascending with [stellarch_nameDef]. It will depart upon your command! -->
    <li>ParadeSuccessLetterText-&gt;O ônibus espacial está pronto para partir com todos os que ascendem com [stellarch_nameDef]. Ele parte quando vocês mandarem!</li>
  </VFEE_Parade.questContentRules.rulesStrings>
